	(text "USB-C: the Part 3 link to the laptop, and the pod's power when the cable is out.\nR2/R3 (5.1 k on CC) tell the laptop this is a device that wants 5 V. U4 clamps ESD on D+/D-\nand VBUS. The shell goes to ground through R4/C15, so it drains static without a ground loop."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
